Executes Docker Compose and orchestration scripts located in orbit/orbit-infra to start/stop local databases, queues, identity services, and developer portals.

Usage:
  orbit dev [command]

Available Commands:
  caddy       Manage local Caddy reverse proxy
  down        Stop local development stack containers
  logs        Stream logs from local dev stack containers
  portal      Open or print the local developer portal URL
  tier2       Start Tier 2 Orbit services (orbit-auth, orbit-notifications, orbit-api-gateway)
  up          Start local development stack containers

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for dev

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit dev [command] --help" for more information about a command.
